openmediavault-clouddrive2 (8.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * WebUI control panel (OpenWrt style): the Services -> CloudDrive2
    page now shows read-only status information (service running state,
    bundled CloudDrive2 version, web interface port) above the settings
    section. The enable switch, configuration directory and the
    immediate start/stop/restart buttons stay on the same page.
  * RPC get() returns the status fields; set() persists only the
    datamodel fields (enable/configdir). CloudDrive2's own features
    and configuration are untouched - they remain managed exclusively
    through its web interface on port 19798.

 -- fffeng99999  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:10:00 +0800

openmediavault-clouddrive2 (8.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: CloudDrive2 plugin for OpenMediaVault 8.x.
    - Bundles the CloudDrive2 core binary (downloaded at build time,
      architecture specific) and its web console.
    - Service managed through the OMV configuration database and Salt
      state (systemd unit generated by 'omv-salt deploy run clouddrive2').
    - WebUI entry: Services -> CloudDrive2 (enable, configuration
      directory, start/stop/restart, link to the CloudDrive2 console).
    - Simplified and Traditional Chinese translations included.

 -- fffeng99999  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:30:00 +0800
